    story: Carmen Wavewraith was born into an exiled noble family, where manners, inheritance, and hidden rivalries carried their own kind of danger. As a child, Carmen Wavewraith lived through a forest survival, learning from weather, hunger, hiding places, and mistakes nobody corrected. As a young adult, Carmen Wavewraith worked through a mercenary medic, learning where bodies fail and how panic moves through a fight. They enter the dojo to pay for medicine, debts, or mercy.
